# Native optional deps for the desktop installers (sharp @img/sharp-*, koffi
# @koromix/koffi-*, node-pty prebuilds) are selected by `supportedArchitectures`
# in pnpm-workspace.yaml — the only place pnpm reads it for both the repo
# install and every `pnpm deploy` (a .npmrc block and --config.supportedArchitectures.*
# CLI flags are both ignored by deploy). Nothing is pinned here.
